@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Create mood (valid)
POST {{host}}/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "note": "Ate burger"
}

### List moods
GET {{host}}/api/moods

### Create mood (invalid – expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 999,
  "note": "oops"
}
